<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <view class="eyebrow">{{pack.courseName}} · {{pack.chapter}}</view>
    <view class="title">{{pack.packageTitle}}</view>
    <view class="subtitle">覆盖微课、图文、练习、动画、音频、视频等 9 类学习资源。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{sourceMessage}}" class="source">{{sourceMessage}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="filters">
    <input value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="onKeyword" placeholder="搜索课程、章节、类型、知识点或标题" />
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{typeOptions}}" bindchange="onTypeChange">
      <view class="picker">{{typeFilter}}</view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <view class="resource-list">
    <view wx:for="{{filteredResources}}" wx:key="title" class="resource-card">
      <view class="resource-head">
        <view>
          <view class="resource-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="resource-meta">{{item.label}} / {{item.difficultyText}} / {{item.estimateText}} 分钟</view>
        </view>
        <view class="resource-type">{{item.type}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="resource-content">{{item.content}}</view>
      <view class="resource-knowledge">知识点：{{item.knowledgeText}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="resource-note">{{item.note}}</view>
      <button bindtap="addResourceTask" data-index="{{index}}">{{item.taskText}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{emptyText}}" class="empty">{{emptyText}}</view>

  <view class="tip">
    动画 HTML 在小程序端展示步骤摘要，完整动画预览、TTS 音频接入和 FFmpeg 视频产物可在 Web 端查看。
  </view>

  <button class="ask" bindtap="goTutor">围绕资源提问</button>
</view>
